patch type="fixed" "Fix a reconnect still running from an earlier session tearing down the next one, so `connect()` returned and the room then dropped to disconnected; `connect()`, `disconnect()` and a server disconnect now run one at a time. A `disconnect()` that interrupts a `connect()` after it connected now reports `.cancelled` to `room(_:didDisconnectWithError:)` instead of `nil`"
